; ======== Calc_RBM_LSH_Up_OBD2  (@0xd4878) ========
        ; ------------------------------------------------------------
        ; OEM-chain (verified by state_rbm_/rate_rbm_ output signals): IUMPR rate-based monitor for LSH Up
        ; OBD2: updates state_rbm_lsh_up_obd2 / rate_rbm_lsh_up_obd2 (in-use completion ratio =
        ; numerator/denominator).
        ; ------------------------------------------------------------
